217571349302}\nEngage in intense **Passthrough Combat** to **rescue the Brainrot**\u2014your only goal is to save them from destruction. This isn't just a game; it's the ultimate **stress-relieving MR experience** where you defend the Brainrot from the safety of your living room.\n\n---\n\n### **Game Features:**\n{1419686969866160}\n* **Insane Scale:** Face **hundreds of enemies on screen** simultaneously in the deep space outside your walls.\n\n{886175917646318}\n* **Window to War:** Your walls disappear, turning your room into a safe haven overlooking the galactic battlefield.\n\n{2969329879923652}\n* **Rescue the Brainrot:** Snatch the legendary Brainrot characters from the enemy clutches before they are lost forever.\n\n{1274194554554068}\n{1479114093555059}", "short_description": "Shatter your walls. Rescue the Brainrot.\n\nWatch your walls crumble to reveal deep space in this high-density MR Space Shooter. Mow down hundreds of enemies swarming the void outside your room in intense Passthrough Combat.\n\nYour mission is simple: Snatch legendary Brainrot characters from destruction. Experience the ultimate stress-relieving chaos with swarms of enemies on screen, turning your room into a safe haven overlooking the galactic battlefield."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.attention.games/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.attention.games/terms", "publisher_name": "Attention Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.attention.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphi